# Combat Design

## Principles

- Every weapon has a **fantasy** (spray, boom, poke, cleave)
- Hits need layered feedback: SFX + flash + number + knock
- Attacks need telegraph → impact → recovery
- Player should feel power without losing readability in hordes

## Checklist

- Time-to-kill vs wave density
- Mag/reload rhythm vs auto-fire boredom
- Melee risk/reward range
- Boss tells distinguishable from grunt spam
